      "role": "user",
      "content": "sometimes i'm just standing in the middle of the subway station at rush hour and it hits me... like, if i just stopped moving, or if i just wasn't here tomorrow, the crowd would just flow right around the empty space and keep going. nobody would even blink. it's like i'm already a ghost in this city.",
