      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable to feel that way, especially when everything seems overwhelming. However, it's essential to remember that stepping out of the way doesn't mean you're stopping it all; instead, it might be giving you the space you need to recharge. Dealing with feeling like this alone can be incredibly challenging, so reaching out to someone who can offer support and understanding is a significant and loving thing to do. You're not a burden; people care about you and want to help when they can. It's okay to ask for help, to take breaks, and to be there for each other without the weight of the world on your shoulders. We all need a little grace sometimes.",
      "source": "target",
